flowchart LR
    author([Author]) -->|Submit| gateway[Gateway]
    subgraph processing[Document processing]
        gateway -->|Validate| valid{Valid?}
        valid -->|Yes| queue[Work queue]
        queue --> worker[Worker]
        worker -->|Write| index[(Search index)]
    end
    valid -.->|Revise| author
    worker -.->|Retry| queue
    reader([Reader]) -->|Search| index
    worker -->|Record| audit[(Audit log)]
